# No em dashes

Never use the em dash character (`—`) in any output: chat replies, docs, marketing copy, UI strings, comments, commit messages, or code you write.

People associate em dashes with AI writing. Prefer commas, periods, colons, parentheses, or hyphens instead. Do not use en dashes as clause separators either.
